{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "96ae4b44be31005f9cf306631f3ba0c05501b9e6502b959dc427d0bc1a9660ba", "ja": "（紬が、アイスのCMに出演することになった。\n今日はその撮影だが、紬はずっと楽しそうだ……）", "zh": "（紬要出演冰淇淋广告了。今天就是拍摄日，不过紬一直都看起来很开心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1feeb1c4d461c206d8a4658de4cde739c7da5b6b4cc521f173761f6047099fc0", "ja": "ふぅ。これでお顔が完成です。\nあら？　まだフルーツが残っていますね……。", "zh": "呼……这样脸就完成了。\n咦？水果还剩一些呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "db83238933b56507b64a4e6edc3921f1263c28ec2cd77bae9e6839f3e6bec511", "ja": "この量なら、もっと華やかにできるかも。\nこぐまのみなさん、お手伝いをお願いできますか？", "zh": "这个量的话，说不定能做得更华丽一些。\n小熊们，可以请你们帮个忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1003_null", "source_sha256": "79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed", "ja": "撮影終了後……", "zh": "拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "47224fc5e6a93ba75b0d42d70977aaeeb786f588ae2915e05132500ffb465283", "ja": "こぐまさん、可愛らしかったな……ふふっ。", "zh": "小熊真可爱啊……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a8ea2063782c5a34acc16fe8ae1fe55ef2af709dd54bc1937d18ea6e58d14b04", "ja": "紬、お疲れ様。ずっと楽しそうだったけど、\nこぐま達のこと、気に入ったみたいだな。", "zh": "紬，辛苦了。你一直都很开心的样子，看来很喜欢小熊们啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1126f0c860083d41f8176d45f263eaf004f5d7e661e428a72f774138f2f18093", "ja": "っ……！　{$P$}！？\nち、近くに居たのなら、すぐに声をかけてください！", "zh": "啊……！{$P$}！？  \n您、您要是在附近，就请马上叫我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9fb346378e144e4b71644826ae741235b9f0c437d7fc087f7c7887d02dc04764", "ja": "あなたという方は……\nどうして盗み聞きなんて意地の悪いことを！", "zh": "你这个人真是的……\n为什么要做偷听这么坏心眼的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1008_p", "source_sha256": "72633725743fe879669ed9d76fe5b30d79d4f1eb7e969b464817e7e40ccc7beb", "ja": "す、すまん！　驚かせるつもりはなくて、\n撮影の感想を伝えにきただけなんだ。", "zh": "对、对不起！我不是想吓到你，只是来告诉你对这次拍摄的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cb3d7391ad42989a75df64ff4fec52a8b06baae7a6b8ce41847a902a5db78fce", "ja": "まったく……それなら、そうと言ってください。\nあなたの言いそうなことは、わかっています。", "zh": "真是的……既然那样，直接说不就好了。\n你想说些什么，我心里很清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7d125ca82a23a44553970edbcf95209c9d3b480c584501ca8cc481a8d469d9da", "ja": "私のはしゃぐ姿を見て、\n子どものようだと思ったのでしょう？", "zh": "看到我兴奋的样子，觉得我像个孩子一样了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ca0fe712262de8e277d3499117bc2dd6c1968183a1a553fd2e7c4f9999dab149", "ja": "そんなことないよ。楽しい気持ちが伝わってきて、\nとてもいいCMになったと思う。", "zh": "没那回事。你传达出了快乐的心情，我觉得这成了非常棒的广告。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ead22bd5c5887a636e4ed11d175d55edc0b7f3abfe0f2d1c7b1685ed5bb63b54", "ja": "まあ、紬がかき氷を食べる練習をしてるって\n聞いた時は、少し驚いたよ。", "zh": "不过，听说紬在练习吃刨冰的时候，我还是有点惊讶的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aeadaf2b93ffe4d5aff22291b8206a512165b26bb449a3e826cf8bcc921d5199", "ja": "そ、それは……頭痛に慣れる練習をしていただけです。\n以前、かき氷で惨めな姿をお見せしてしまったので。", "zh": "那、那是……只是在练习适应头痛而已。\n之前因为吃刨冰，让您看到了我狼狈的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2288863d55231c649b7626c2f06eab5301a727ca7cc87248758373b63f1ee880", "ja": "ああ。かき氷の食レポのことか。\nあれはあれでよかったと思うけど……。", "zh": "啊，是说刨冰的试吃点评吗？我觉得那样也挺好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d351b64731691a91a82527a312bc4b2eb52ebd7e1b57f8b99c50021246b57876", "ja": "いえ、私がよくありません。\n失態を繰り返さないようにと思っていたのに……。", "zh": "不，是我做得不够好。\n明明想着不能再重蹈覆辙的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "371b8ea8999c0913455fc50a8ae35ce0983492fbff1048db26f0dc86ca0574ee", "ja": "このような可愛らしい内容だと知っていたら、\nもっと別の練習をしていました。", "zh": "如果早知道是这么可爱的内容，我就会练习别的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a5eb993b8a7403bcbe8e85267564f22d93ed2bc1807b6b30f98f4d6637182a0b", "ja": "伝えるのが遅くなって、すまなかったな。でも\n今回のCMは、ファンの人達も喜んでくれると思う。", "zh": "让你这么晚才知道，真是抱歉。不过，我想这次的广告粉丝们也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "71d3a18d157a9abab6435a26579b9b519bb7a5db04ae88655109a3ea722ee07a", "ja": "そう、ですか……。\nそれなら、よかったです。", "zh": "这样啊……  \n那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1019_p", "source_sha256": "84603aac235cffb86af943228c2bc34fe9b507e58a7e087d65599e8511081e11", "ja": "撮影も無事に終わったし、\nこの後、かき氷を食べに行かないか？", "zh": "拍摄也顺利结束了，接下来要不要一起去吃刨冰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28902d4628310faf99c7729e96e3e8d3c46a2eb5fa5c7c49b57fbff8741f0caa", "ja": "それは構いませんが……。\n突然どうしたのですか？　まさか何か企んで……。", "zh": "我倒是没意见……可是，你怎么突然想吃刨冰了？难道是又在打什么主意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b1180d8a76fd9fd04db9ac9a6ce5dfe4a308321191220762546a15b831e01451", "ja": "何も企んでないよ。\n撮影をみてたら、ちょっと食べたくなったんだ。", "zh": "我没在打什么主意哦。\n看着拍摄，突然有点想吃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c5ddc38d607a3f0cb86cf4ac9032a41c307f0b584fbae7fd7616a4df1c4775c7", "ja": "なるほど。そのお気持ちは、少しわかる気がします。\nそれに、申し出を断る理由もありませんから。", "zh": "原来如此。我好像有点明白你的心情了。\n而且，也没有理由拒绝你的提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0254_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9471e0627abc7597151fa5f7462d807fad1405dcdfae5fcafcd2eb4f56bdf3db", "ja": "練習の成果を披露……いえ、頭痛が起きない\nかき氷の食べ方をお見せしましょう。ふふっ♪", "zh": "我来展示一下练习的成果……不，还是给您看看吃刨冰时不会头痛的方法吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
